 \u201cjump to now-playing track\u201d action on Linux by extending the browser scroll controller to expose viewport metrics, then updating the crumb jump glyph to appear when (a) the playing track is in a different folder **or** (b) it\u2019s in the **current** folder but its row is currently outside the visible browser region.\n\n### Code changes\n- **`lib/widgets/void_browser.dart`**\n  - Added `BrowserScrollMetrics` + `VoidBrowserController.scrollMetricsNotifier`\n  - Updated viewport metrics on scroll (`offset` + `viewportDimension`)\n- **`lib/screens/void_screen.dart`**\n  - Jump glyph now shows when the playing row is **off-screen even if already in the correct folder**\n  - Semantics label updated to: **\u201cjump to now-playing track\u201d**\n  - No action is shown when no track is playing\n\n### Screenshots (Linux)\n**Before** (playing track is off-screen; action is exposed):\n- `/workspace/.tmp/agent_shots/before_now_playing_offscreen.png`\n\n**After** (row scrolled into view; browser stays in the same folder):\n- `/workspace/.tmp/agent_shots/after_now_playing_scrolled_delayed.png`","final_stop_reason":"stop","stop_reasons":{"completed":95},"truncated_turns":0,"final_error":null,"usage":{"aggregate":{"tokens":{"input":65030,"output":28863,"reasoning":21255,"cacheRead":4575744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":4669637},"cost_usd":{"total":0.14059963000000003,"breakdown":{"input":0.013006000000000002,"output":0.03607875000000001,"cacheRead":0.09151487999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.14059963000000003}},"cost_missing":false},"final":{"tokens":{"input":198,"output":407,"reasoning":145,"cacheRead":82944,"cacheWrite":0,"total":83549},"cost_usd":{"total":0.00220723,"breakdown":{"input":3.96e-05,"output":0.0005087500000000001,"cacheRead":0.00165888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00220723}},"cost_missing":false}},"served_models":[{"provider":"azure-openai-responses","model":"gpt-5.4-nano"}]},"cost_usd":{"admission":0.00116585,"candidate":0.14059963000000003,"combined":0.14176548